<%- include('../partials/admin-header') %><div class="admin-intro"><p>Operational analytics derived from booking and quotation records. Quotation totals are estimated values, not revenue.</p><a class="button button-outline" href="/admin/reports/export.csv">Export monthly CSV</a></div><form class="admin-filters"><label><span>From</span><input type="date" name="from" value="<%= filters.from %>"></label><label><span>To</span><input type="date" name="to" value="<%= filters.to %>"></label><button class="button">Apply date range</button><a class="button button-ghost" href="/admin/reports">Clear</a></form><div class="kpi-grid report-kpis"><article><div><small>Total bookings</small><strong><%= summary.total||0 %></strong></div></article><article><div><small>Completion rate</small><strong><%= summary.total?Math.round((summary.completed||0)/summary.total*100):0 %>%</strong></div></article><article><div><small>Cancellation rate</small><strong><%= summary.total?Math.round((summary.cancelled||0)/summary.total*100):0 %>%</strong></div></article><article><div><small>Quotation value</small><strong><%= h.formatINR(summary.quotation_value||0) %></strong><em>Estimated, not collected</em></div></article></div><div class="chart-grid"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Service category demand</h2><p>Bookings in selected date range</p></div></div><div class="horizontal-bars"><% const max=Math.max(1,...categories.map(x=>x.count));categories.forEach(c=>{ %><div><span><b><%= c.name %></b><em><%= c.count %></em></span><i><b data-width="<%= Math.round(c.count/max*100) %>"></b></i></div><% }) %></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Technician workload</h2><p>Assigned and completed jobs</p></div></div><div class="category-list"><% techs.forEach((t,i)=>{ %><div><span class="rank"><%= i+1 %></span><strong><%= t.name %></strong><em><%= t.workload %> assigned · <%= t.completed||0 %> complete</em></div><% }) %></div></section></div><div class="notice admin-notice"><strong>Interpretation</strong><span>Reports include clearly seeded demonstration data until it is reset or replaced by real operational records.</span></div><%- include('../partials/admin-footer') %>